    "%lld개 음표를 인식했습니다 (실험적).\n음높이·길이는 직접 확인하고 고쳐 주세요." : {
      "comment" : "OMR success; %lld = note count",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld개 음표를 인식했습니다 (실험적).\n음높이·길이는 직접 확인하고 고쳐 주세요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notes recognized: %lld (experimental).\nPlease check the pitches and lengths and fix them by hand."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notes recognised: %lld (experimental).\nPlease check the pitches and lengths and fix them by hand."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已识别音符：%lld（实验性）。\n请自行核对音高和时值并修改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已辨識音符：%lld（實驗性）。\n請自行確認音高與長度並加以修改。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "認識した音符：%lld（試験機能）。\n音の高さと長さは自分で確認して直してください。"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Распознано нот: %lld (эксперимент).\nПроверьте высоту и длительность и поправьте вручную."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notas reconocidas: %lld (experimental).\nRevisa las alturas y duraciones y corrígelas a mano."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erkannte Noten: %lld (experimentell).\nPrüfe Tonhöhen und Längen und korrigiere sie von Hand."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notes reconnues : %lld (expérimental).\nVérifiez les hauteurs et les durées, puis corrigez-les à la main."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Note riconosciute: %lld (sperimentale).\nControlla altezze e durate e correggile a mano."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notas reconhecidas: %lld (experimental).\nConfira as alturas e as durações e corrija à mão."
          }
        }
      }
    },
